---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Costume Archive
permalink: /archive/
---
<h1>Costume Archive</h1>
<p>Every costume we've built, newest first.</p>

<div class="archive-list">
{% for post in collections.buildLogs %}
  <a class="archive-item theme-{{ post.data.theme }}" href="{{ post.url }}">
    <span class="archive-year">{{ post.data.year }}</span>
    <span class="archive-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
    <span class="archive-costume">{{ post.data.costume }}</span>
    {% if post.data.placement %}<span class="archive-placement">{{ post.data.placement }}</span>{% endif %}
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
